  Player flavour labels.

  Same reason as the admin flavour: cap sync rewrites the default strings.xml
  from capacitor.config.ts, and the default res/ folder would then hold whatever
  was synced last. Pinning them here makes `assembleUserDebug` independent of
  build order.
-->
